  "— alerts on new matches",
  "“Autofill from photo” sends your cover photo, and “Polish with AI” sends your description, to Google (Gemini) to suggest the details and tidy the wording. Nothing is sent until you tap one of them. Not now: you fill in the listing yourself; everything else works the same.",
  "“Autofill from photo” sends your cover photo, and “Polish with AI” your description, to Google (Gemini). Off: these two buttons are unavailable.",
  "“Fill it in from my CV” sends the CV you choose to Google (Gemini) to fill in your teacher profile. Nothing is sent until you choose a file, and eno does not keep the file. Not now: you fill in your profile yourself.",
  "“Identity verified” now shows on your profile.",
  "“Identity verified” — while your identity check is current and the name on your profile matches your ID (never your document); you can hide it",
  "“Improve with AI” sends your About text and your answers in the teacher profile form to Google (Gemini) on Google Cloud, outside Vietnam, to rewrite the text — never your profile’s name or phone number field, photo, video or CV. Off: you write it yourself.",
  "“Improve with AI” sends your About text, in your own words (minus sentences where we find contact details), to Google (Gemini) on Google Cloud, outside Vietnam, to rewrite it — with your answers in the teacher profile form.",
